    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-8">SOC 2 Compliance</h1>

    <p>Service Organization Control (SOC 2) is a framework designed to ensure that service providers securely manage data to protect the interests of their organization and the privacy of its clients.</p>

    <h2>Infrastructure Security</h2>
    <p>usignpdf is built on top of world-class cloud infrastructure providers (AWS). Our hosting environments are audited regularly and maintain <strong>SOC 2 Type II</strong> certification, ensuring adherence to strict Trust Services Criteria regarding:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> Protection against unauthorized access.</li>
        <li><strong>Availability:</strong> The system is available for operation and use.</li>
        <li><strong>Processing Integrity:</strong> System processing is complete, valid, accurate, timely, and authorized.</li>
        <li><strong>Confidentiality:</strong> Information designated as confidential is protected.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Personal information is collected, used, retained, disclosed, and disposed of appropriately.</li>
    </ul>
